{"seq":2,"slug":"pony-performance","title":"性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/pony-actor-language/practice/pony-performance","wordCount":1911,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能\">性能</h1><p>Pony 常被贴上「快」的标签，但这个标签需要拆开来看——它在哪些维度快、快的机制是什么、又在哪些负载下并不占优甚至吃亏。把这些讲清楚，比笼统喊「高性能」有用得多。Pony 的性能优势不是来自某个孤立的优化，而是前几章那些设计决定的自然结果：<a href=\"../reference-capabilities/isolation-sharing\">隔离与共享</a> 的零拷贝、<a href=\"../runtime/per-actor-gc\">每 Actor 垃圾回收</a> 的无停顿、<a href=\"../runtime/actor-scheduling\">Actor 调度</a> 的 work-stealing。这一篇把这些优势归位，给数字也给前提，并诚实交代它不擅长的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能这一侧的术语，先把要谈的维度定义清楚。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零拷贝消息（zero-copy messaging）</strong>：因为 iso 全局唯一，大对象在 actor 间「过户」只是移动一个指针，成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与负载大小无关。</li>\n<li><strong>尾延迟（P99/P99.9）</strong>：最慢那 1%（或 0.1%）请求的延迟；Pony 的无停顿 GC 主攻的正是这个尖峰。</li>\n<li><strong>无停顿（no STW）</strong>：不存在让所有线程一起暂停的全局 GC 时刻，回收打散进各 actor 的消息间隙。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存局部性（cache locality）</strong>：对象分配在 actor 私有堆、连续访问时内存相对聚集，减少缓存未命中。</li>\n<li><strong>并行占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：问题中可并行完成的工作比例，直接决定加速比的天花板。</li>\n<li><strong>Amdahl 定律</strong>：加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(N) = \\dfrac{1}{(1-p) + p/N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，串行部分会封住多核收益，也是 Pony 优势的边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括本篇的诚实结论：<strong>Pony 只快在它被设计来快的地方——高并发、消息驱动、对尾延迟敏感的服务端负载；别的地方它可能只是「够用」甚至落后。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三个真实的性能优势\">三个真实的性能优势</h2><p>Pony 的性能故事有三根支柱，每一根都能追溯到一个具体的语言/运行时机制。</p>\n<p><strong>零拷贝消息传递。</strong> <a href=\"../reference-capabilities/isolation-sharing\">隔离与共享</a> 讲过，iso 让一个大对象在 Actor 间「过户」而非拷贝，成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对比 Erlang 那种「发消息即深拷贝」的模型，当消息负载大时差距悬殊——传一个一兆字节的缓冲区，Pony 移动一个指针，Erlang 拷贝一兆字节。这是引用能力用类型安全换来的、别的安全 Actor 语言拿不到的性能。</p>\n<p><strong>无停顿带来的尾延迟优势。</strong> 这是 Pony 最值得说的一点。传统 GC 语言的 P99/P99.9 延迟常被 STW 停顿主导——绝大多数请求很快，但撞上一次全局 GC 就是几十甚至上百毫秒的尖峰。<a href=\"../runtime/per-actor-gc\">每 Actor 垃圾回收</a> 的 ORCA 没有全局 STW，回收被打散进每个 Actor 的消息间隙，尾延迟因此显著更平。对延迟敏感、要求稳定 P99 的服务（交易、实时流），这一条往往比「平均吞吐高 10%」更值钱。</p>\n<p><strong>缓存友好的每 Actor 堆。</strong> 每个 Actor 的对象分配在自己的私有堆里，一个 Actor 连续处理消息时访问的数据在内存上相对聚集，缓存局部性好；加上无锁、无原子操作争用（Actor 内串行，跨 Actor 靠消息），避免了共享内存并发里的缓存行乒乓（false sharing）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;Pony 性能三支柱&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;零拷贝消息&lt;br/&gt;iso 过户 O(1)&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;无停顿 GC&lt;br/&gt;尾延迟平稳&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;每 Actor 私有堆&lt;br/&gt;缓存局部性 + 无锁&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;源自引用能力&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;源自 ORCA 运行时&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;源自 Actor 隔离&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"Pony 性能三支柱\"] --&gt; B[\"零拷贝消息&lt;br/&gt;iso 过户 O(1)\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"无停顿 GC&lt;br/&gt;尾延迟平稳\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"每 Actor 私有堆&lt;br/&gt;缓存局部性 + 无锁\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"源自引用能力\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"源自 ORCA 运行时\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"源自 Actor 隔离\"]</pre><h2 id=\"优势成立的前提\">优势成立的前提</h2><p>上面每条优势都有触发条件，脱离条件就不成立——这是被「高性能」宣传掩盖最多的部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>真正兑现的前提</th>\n<th>前提不满足时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零拷贝</td>\n<td>消息负载大、且能表达成 iso/val</td>\n<td>小消息下拷贝本就便宜，优势不明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾延迟平稳</td>\n<td>高分配率、对 P99 敏感的负载</td>\n<td>低分配或不在乎尾延迟时，收益有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存局部性</td>\n<td>工作能切成大量独立 Actor</td>\n<td>强串行依赖的工作无从并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高吞吐</td>\n<td>消息驱动、天然并行的问题</td>\n<td>单线程标量计算，Actor 开销纯负担</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把「零拷贝」这条优势落到代码上，就是把大负载表达成 iso 再 consume 发出去——发送侧只花常数时间，无论负载多大：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pony\" data-code=\"actor Pipeline&#10;  let _next: Consumer&#10;  new create(next: Consumer) =&gt; _next = next&#10;&#10;  be forward(frame: Array[U8] iso) =&gt;&#10;    // 不拷贝：只把这块内存的所有权移交给下游 actor&#10;    _next.ingest(consume frame)   // O(1)，与 frame.size() 无关\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>actor Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let _next: Consumer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  new create(next: Consumer) => _next = next</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  be forward(frame: Array[U8] iso) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 不拷贝：只把这块内存的所有权移交给下游 actor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _next.ingest(consume frame)   // O(1)，与 frame.size() 无关</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个关键前提是<strong>问题本身要能并行</strong>。Pony 的调度器能把百万 Actor 铺满所有核，但如果你的问题本质上是一条长串行依赖链（后一步必须等前一步），再多核也用不上，Actor 的消息传递开销反而是纯粹的负担。设有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 比例的工作可并行、机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 核，加速比受 Amdahl 定律封顶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(N) = \\frac{1}{(1-p) + \\dfrac{p}{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.005em;vertical-align:-1.6836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3376em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7846em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1（高度并行）时 Pony 的运行时优势才充分释放；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 迅速趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1-p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这个天花板，语言选型再怎么优化都撞在同一堵墙上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"它不擅长什么-一个诚实的基准\">它不擅长什么：一个诚实的基准</h2><p>不能只讲赢的场景。Pony 社区自己就公开讨论过它在某些基准里表现平平——例如某些 HTTP 服务器基准中 Pony 并没有跑赢成熟的 C/C++/Rust 方案。原因值得记：一是标准库与生态还不够成熟，很多热路径没有被像主流语言那样反复调优过；二是 Pony 的强项是「大量并发 Actor + 消息」，而一个朴素的 HTTP echo 基准更考验单连接的原始 IO 路径，那不是 Pony 架构优势的用武之地；三是 pre-1.0 阶段，编译器优化和 runtime 调参仍在演进。</p>\n<p>诚实的结论是：<strong>Pony 快在它被设计来快的地方——高并发、消息驱动、对尾延迟敏感的服务端负载；在别的地方，它可能只是「够用」甚至落后</strong>。把它当成「万能的高性能语言」去替换所有场景，很可能失望。选型时该问的不是「Pony 快不快」，而是「我的负载是不是恰好落在它三支柱都成立的那个区间」——这个判断留给 <a href=\"pony-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么量自己的负载\">怎么量自己的负载</h2><p>不要照搬别人的 benchmark 数字，那些数字的前提可能和你的负载南辕北辙。务实的做法是：用你真实负载的一个缩影去压测，重点看两组指标——吞吐（每秒处理消息/请求数）和延迟分布（尤其 P99/P99.9，这是 Pony 无停顿优势最该显形的地方）。压测时留意 <a href=\"../runtime/causal-messaging\">因果消息与背压</a> 的 mute/unmute 是否被触发：如果生产快于消费，背压会自动限速，这会体现在吞吐曲线的平台上——那不是 bug，是运行时在保护你，但它意味着你的消费侧是瓶颈。官方也维护了一份性能调优的经验清单（Performance Cheat Sheet），涵盖分配、消息设计等实操建议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三根性能支柱：iso 零拷贝消息（源自引用能力）、ORCA 无停顿 GC 带来的平稳尾延迟（源自运行时）、每 Actor 私有堆的缓存局部性与无锁（源自 Actor 隔离）。</li>\n<li>每条优势都有前提：大消息、高分配率、可切成独立 Actor、问题本身可并行；脱离前提优势消失。</li>\n<li>加速比受 Amdahl 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(N)=1/((1-p)+p/N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 约束，串行依赖强的问题再多核也无益。</li>\n<li>诚实交代弱项：某些 HTTP 基准 Pony 并不领先，因生态未充分调优、且那类基准不在其架构强项上。</li>\n<li>别照搬 benchmark，用真实负载缩影压测吞吐与 P99/P99.9，留意背压是否触发。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"c-ffi\">C FFI 互操作</a>（FFI 零开销对性能的贡献）、<a href=\"pony-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a>（性能优势如何转化为选型判断）</li>\n<li>跨章：<a href=\"../reference-capabilities/isolation-sharing\">隔离与共享</a>（零拷贝的来源）、<a href=\"../runtime/per-actor-gc\">每 Actor 垃圾回收</a>（无停顿的来源）、<a href=\"../runtime/actor-scheduling\">Actor 调度</a>、<a href=\"../runtime/causal-messaging\">因果消息与背压</a></li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/performance-benchmarking\">Rust 的性能与基准测试</a>、<a href=\"../../erlang-otp/actor-model/scheduling-runtime\">Erlang 的调度与运行时</a></li>\n<li>来源：<a href=\"https://www.ponylang.io/reference/pony-performance-cheatsheet/\">Performance Cheat Sheet（官方）</a>、<a href=\"https://pony.groups.io/g/user/topic/pony_did_poorly_in_a_recent/5411536\">Pony did poorly in a recent http server benchmark（社区讨论）</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能","id":"性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个真实的性能优势","id":"三个真实的性能优势"},{"level":2,"text":"优势成立的前提","id":"优势成立的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"它不擅长什么：一个诚实的基准","id":"它不擅长什么-一个诚实的基准"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么量自己的负载","id":"怎么量自己的负载"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"C FFI 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/pony-actor-language/practice/c-ffi"},"next":{"title":"选型与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/pony-actor-language/practice/pony-when-to-use"}}